==Battleground==
*8 [[Zoge]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 43.33~50 seconds<sup>1,300f~1,500f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Cerberus Kids]] spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*2 [[Aku Doge]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Aku Doge]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Aku Doge]]s spawn, delay 23.33~30 seconds<sup>700f~900f</sup>.
**5 [[Znache]]s spawn, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
**3 [[Zigge]]s spawn, delay 30~33.33 seconds<sup>900f~1,000f</sup>.
**2 [[Aku Gory|Aku Gories]] spawn, delay 23.33~26.67 seconds<sup>700f~800f</sup>.

==Strategy==
The main threats in this stage are the 2 Aku Gories that appear when the base reaches 99% HP. This can easily be handled with units with [[Area Attack]] like [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Cyborg Cat]] or [[Figure Skating Cats (Super Rare Cat)|Drama Cats]] along with meatshields.

==Trivia==
*This, [[Otherworld Meadow]] and [[Sinister Wasteland]] all use backgrounds from the [[Nazousagi Collaboration Event]].

